@WorkReady.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

### Plan a job -> 201 Created, returns the new jobId
POST {{WorkReady.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "technicianId": "0198c2a4-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "siteId": "0198c2a4-0000-7000-8000-000000000002",
  "workType": "HighVoltage",
  "plannedStart": "2026-10-06T08:00:00Z"
}

### Start a job -> 200 OK (a freshly planned job has no evidence yet, so the domain rejects it)
@jobId = paste-the-jobId-from-the-response-above
POST {{WorkReady.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/start

###
